c_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCdqw_TssoZVj0Pz5Ts2XeC1Eq1z4nWsQ0UDCX1Osq9qQ&oe=6A5236BD"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_2025-11-27_01-17-32.png", "id": "1930409177890325", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618274_1930409181223658_8736833320798193068_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lvqTI2aNoZAQ7kNvwFQr8dy&_nc_oc=AdoBu2nAXR2yEkPlw0Xzl22czoxYAdqcMB5bvI0k2nZv1tUvRRWJh2a52JgVlk173hI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCF_-v2iOg9NqEW7mRnL3fGybAEr3gvEmbk5CGle7X4Kg&oe=6A526566"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_2025-11-27_01-19-31.png", "id": "1629465884701485", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620860_1629465891368151_7596993720465277411_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7qqOp8U5Q0oQ7kNvwEDMncc&_nc_oc=Ado-JXzZo2kSBfyFRV81wbPuWx04qKIWZDCnXeh4yJ9MqEydkECmZSusV_jkndl5AWI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBR1saaMemSm578fQlq2A_IiDBZxEk71SP9V3Dgku9u2A&oe=6A524060"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "boombox - NEW long PSD copy.png", "id": "2476971029387482", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623384_2476971032720815_8359497004520360689_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8ZjUdNCwBKIQ7kNvwFuPykK&_nc_oc=AdqstYn77KU4Nq88-4Wr9GuMhvYS1v3h0oaJhhCEhy0J5HaSpBn0hxxCBwInybehZZs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAJzEiqEcigrWjOvd1MazWeVhLEQD4Rlv0VFWO_G1nmJw&oe=6A525757"}, "display_name": "BoomBox Remastered", "keywords": ["fitness", "social", "dancing", "pets", "rhythm"], "long_description": "BoomBox is back!!!\nRemastered. Remixed. Reborn with soul and a heartbeat you can feel through your controllers. \n\nNo more modding. No setup. Everything is already here.\n\nBoomBox lets you drum, move, and turn your energy into rhythm inside vibrant worlds that react to every beat.\n{802141276210555}\n\n**\ud83c\udfb6 All Community Maps. Built Right In. \ud83c\udfb6**\n\nEvery custom song, every map, every wild idea lives inside the game.\nBrowse, download, and play instantly.\n\nNo mods. No file hunting. No barriers.\n{852084144270068}\n\n**Fitness. Dancing. Flow!**\n\nTrain, chase perfect combos, or move with the music your way.\nFrom fitness sessions to full-on dance runs, BoomBox adapts to how you play.\n{759252033161179}\n\nYou\u2019re not just playing. You\u2019re part of it.\n\n**Key Features**\n\n**\ud83c\udfb5 150+ Maps & Growing**: All community-made maps available directly in-game. No mods. Ever.\n\n**\ud83e\udd41 Drumming Gameplay**: Grab your sticks and hit with power, precision, and flow.\n\n**\ud83c\udfc6 Achievements & Unlockables**: Earn skins, rewards, and milestones as you play.\n\n**\u2728 Reactive Worlds**: Check out our vibrant environments that move with the music.\n\n**\ud83d\udcaa Fitness That Works**: Maps built for movement, rhythm, and progression.\n\n**\ud83d\udd7a Dance & Flow Gameplay**: Not just rhythm, full-body movement and expression.\n\n**\ud83c\udfa8 Create in One Click**: Build and share your own maps easily.\n\n**\ud83d\udc65 Community-Driven**: Every update shaped by real players.\n\n**\ud83d\ude3b Pupa is Back**: Your companion. Yes, you can pet her.\n\n{1169806711549886}", "short_description": "BoomBox is back, remastered with a whole lot of beat.\nNo more modding. Everything is already here.\nDrum your way through 150+ maps in breathtaking environments, with every community-created song available right inside the game. Unlock skins, earn achievements, train with fitness maps or move to full-on dance sessions, and meet your own Pupa cat along the way.\n\nThis is rhythm, fitness, and expression in one place, shaped by a passionate community that drives every update."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.boomboxvr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Cyberspline Games Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://di